      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_39022c171dbf11eb5b6ba494_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are two ways to toggle the right sidebar:",
      "sourceHash": "39022c171dbf11eb5b6ba4943daf247f24144fa3985e66438a5befffb5862f4f",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Toggling the right sidebar",
      "contextHash": "c6b08527d6d34dd699bc529436ff216c48d7b7d9b8c792e0ebb9722a310d3f97",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_17430a3cd0165c16527ec126_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Via the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ icon near the title bar, which toggles whether the sidebar is docked.",
      "sourceHash": "17430a3cd0165c16527ec126ca765c460c5dd5cf52e5e76905b7e29339a5b00b",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Toggling the right sidebar",
      "contextHash": "c6b08527d6d34dd699bc529436ff216c48d7b7d9b8c792e0ebb9722a310d3f97",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_965032258c3a443650caeea8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Via the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Toggle right pane__TRILIUM_PH_1__ __TRILIUM_PH_2__keyboard shortcut__TRILIUM_PH_3__, which is not assigned by default.",
      "sourceHash": "965032258c3a443650caeea83f50569f8866a60756b76e0ea6528d8aa3534a90",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Toggling the right sidebar",
      "contextHash": "c6b08527d6d34dd699bc529436ff216c48d7b7d9b8c792e0ebb9722a310d3f97",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_033b02a0e04f03acdf82967f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Peeking the sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "033b02a0e04f03acdf82967f6b790773ad46fd711955f21c142a93a84382e180",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_88de0ffe22811c956febedf7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There is a small strip near the right edge of the app which shows an arrow icon.",
      "sourceHash": "88de0ffe22811c956febedf7a15825d01f58549b69a324444706d95376e0cc9f",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3ae6f73703956503a6816d67_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When the sidebar is hidden, pressing the edge will __TRILIUM_PH_0__peek__TRILIUM_PH_1__ the sidebar.",
      "sourceHash": "3ae6f73703956503a6816d67e9d4e0fd0084c0ee74c8ffb6209b6a87375859d3",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5ee0efe97bea65b8211d6882_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In this mode the sidebar is shown temporarily above the content, without shifting the content of your notes.",
      "sourceHash": "5ee0efe97bea65b8211d6882acad370b44876fbaec4840c66cadcd99e77ef106",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ba996d0c909c2a7c950e29b6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking outside the sidebar while in peek mode will simply hide the sidebar. Same goes for the X button and clicking on the right edge.",
      "sourceHash": "ba996d0c909c2a7c950e29b646c48e67d5c646280995686d0db3f8a17984d791",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dba85c7a5309e1b2fbe6fdca_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Pressing the pin icon will dock the sidebar.",
      "sourceHash": "dba85c7a5309e1b2fbe6fdcabacd7289757c7a43129c500f41778090e44eeb4c",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_347e3a360af95ba1b47b7094_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When the sidebar is docked, pressing the edge will hide the sidebar (similar to the toggle icon at the top).",
      "sourceHash": "347e3a360af95ba1b47b709488b661862d582b639e5a6584cc3189a3f820ea93",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3b517964fdbfc6aff141658d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Peek Right Pane__TRILIUM_PH_1__ __TRILIUM_PH_2__keyboard shortcut__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_5__+__TRILIUM_PH_6__]__TRILIUM_PH_7__ by default, does the same as pressing the strip.",
      "sourceHash": "3b517964fdbfc6aff141658db8ff7a639db135cc92fbe7f3be51d83fe6f020ef",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Peeking the sidebar",
      "contextHash": "7892ec8469e1e429450f7a9547c63423208de30c97c59115e2dbbbacd8e658a0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d811f86b461cb28f75e7629e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Mobile support__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d811f86b461cb28f75e7629ef3e87340602de43ec52a4e8d49520fe6f503cdb3",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "e0867db1eeda22cb975959e089b2ad89c75acba5f49ccda3d7c5a8c329ffb9d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3fe4676ec9c7b996c491504a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On mobile, the right sidebar is replaced by the note panel, which opens as a sheet at the bottom of the screen from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button beside the __TRILIUM_PH_1__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_2__.",
      "sourceHash": "3fe4676ec9c7b996c491504abe8bd484a7673d5d4a71a44f3c5c9c5372d66135",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "e0867db1eeda22cb975959e089b2ad89c75acba5f49ccda3d7c5a8c329ffb9d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8494c90fa7d6b325a3076d9c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The tabs are switched from a bar at the bottom of the sheet. As on desktop, a tab with nothing to show for the current note is left out, and the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Widgets__TRILIUM_PH_1__ tab lists the __TRILIUM_PH_2__right pane widgets__TRILIUM_PH_3__ of scripts.",
      "sourceHash": "8494c90fa7d6b325a3076d9c6ed8d64395cc3903418e4fa6bd031c1b15a7f774",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "e0867db1eeda22cb975959e089b2ad89c75acba5f49ccda3d7c5a8c329ffb9d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_de0db6ab96944ed14d303982_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The sections of a tab are displayed one after the other as cards, each with its name above it, instead of collapsible sections.",
      "sourceHash": "de0db6ab96944ed14d3039827980a76629091ae324f9f1dd83db285d401c0008",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "e0867db1eeda22cb975959e089b2ad89c75acba5f49ccda3d7c5a8c329ffb9d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8a44a53c282e0c3181f0ee08_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The header of the sheet shows the name of the tab, except in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__AI chat__TRILIUM_PH_3__ tabs, where it holds their buttons instead (see __TRILIUM_PH_4__Attributes tab__TRILIUM_PH_5__ and __TRILIUM_PH_6__AI chat tab__TRILIUM_PH_7__).",
      "sourceHash": "8a44a53c282e0c3181f0ee0867efee73296d9b61f502d4f91ed91fbf9fdb1d9a",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "e0867db1eeda22cb975959e089b2ad89c75acba5f49ccda3d7c5a8c329ffb9d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bc857ce478c92f00200a6b39_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Tapping a heading of the table of contents, or a page or an annotation of a PDF, closes the panel and scrolls the note to it.",
      "sourceHash": "bc857ce478c92f00200a6b39d91cfb65f6367eddb7303df6adcecb0404fe0d51",
      "context": "Right Sidebar > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "e0867db1eeda22cb975959e089b2ad89c75acba5f49ccda3d7c5a8c329ffb9d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
